WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:03.930
(mystic guitar music)
(grunting)

00:00:03.930 --> 00:00:05.810
- [Narrator] Mayan dances are a huge part

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:08.459
of Guatemalan history and religion.

00:00:08.459 --> 00:00:09.790
(grunting)
In the ancient ritual

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:12.293
of the deer dance, it's
particularly important.

00:00:21.592 --> 00:00:23.925
(crackling)

00:00:24.761 --> 00:00:28.502
(mystic guitar music)

00:00:28.502 --> 00:00:32.380
(whistling)
(rhythmic drumming)

00:00:32.380 --> 00:00:33.910
- [Narrator] The Feast of Corpus Christi,

00:00:33.910 --> 00:00:37.480
celebrated on May 31st,
is a huge Catholic holiday

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:39.543
in Central and South American countries.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:43.973
Guatemala is no exception.

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:46.450
There, it's a celebration

00:00:46.450 --> 00:00:49.323
filled with tradition, ritual and dance.

00:00:51.280 --> 00:00:53.810
As part of the holiday,
the villagers of Patzún

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:56.490
come together to put on the deer dance.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:59.040
Juan Yool Gómez has been
participating in the dance

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:01.440
for over 20 years, but this tradition

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:03.283
goes back much farther than that.

00:01:14.819 --> 00:01:17.152
(crackling)

00:01:18.942 --> 00:01:19.775
(murmuring)

00:01:19.775 --> 00:01:21.108
(playful music)

00:01:21.108 --> 00:01:21.941
(grunting)

00:01:21.941 --> 00:01:24.880
- [Narrator] The deer dance
represents a deer hunt.

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:27.700
It's intending to show how
humans and other animals

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:30.608
have had to coexist in
nature throughout history.

00:01:30.608 --> 00:01:32.941
(whistling)

00:01:58.233 --> 00:02:00.816
(mystic music)

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.130
(grunting)

00:02:40.515 --> 00:02:43.848
(pretty stringed music)

00:02:55.888 --> 00:02:58.138
(grunting)

00:03:01.483 --> 00:03:04.483
(rhythmic drumming)

00:03:19.096 --> 00:03:21.513
(sonic beep)

